:seed: renta-2025-retencion
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A
@capture work_unit_id result.work_unit_id
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work calculate --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-anterior=0 --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-em4-pendiente-inicio=0 --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-em3-pendiente-inicio=0 --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-em2-pendiente-inicio=0
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work attest-work-income {work_unit_id} --yes
@capture stated_revision_id result.calculation_revision_id
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work verify {stated_revision_id}
@step Export the checked declaration to a local file; it is labelled as not an AEAT receipt.
@result aeat --format json app modelo export {work_unit_id} --revision {stated_revision_id} --output ./modelo-100.boe
@expect exit_code == 0
@expect result.modelo == "100"
@step After you upload at the portal, record the filing in Cadrumo.
@static aeat app modelo work file --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A
@blocked obligation-window The Renta 2025 window opens 2026-04-08 and the sandbox clock is 2026-04-01: "No pending filing obligation for this profile at the current date".
@step Pull the justificante and reconcile it against the filed record (a live AEAT read).
@static aeat app modelo reconcile pull --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A
@blocked live-aeat The pull verb fetches from the AEAT sede; the sandbox refuses live frames.
